{"root":"pli/ms","translators":["sujato"],"title":"Rakkhita","html":"<article id='thag1.79'><header><ul><li class='division'><span class='root'>Theragāthā 1.79 </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Verses of the Senior Monks 1.79 </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Ekakanipāta </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Book of the Ones </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Aṭṭhamavagga </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Chapter Eight </span></li></ul>\n<h1 class='sutta-title'><span class='root'>Rakkhitattheragāthā </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Rakkhita </span></h1></header>\n<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>“Sabbo rāgo pahīno me, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>All my lust is given up, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>sabbo doso samūhato; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>all my hate is eradicated, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Sabbo me vigato moho, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>all my delusion is gone: </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>sītibhūtosmi nibbuto”ti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>I’m cooled, quenched. </span></span></p></blockquote>\n<p class='endsutta'><span class='root'>… Rakkhito thero …. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p></article>"}
